          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("3 VI, 23 YW We crossed the high plateaus, and forded the Arkan-thoria. Then we headed up into the mountains again before we found the mage. This was Ras-Tabahn’s plan, and with the goal in sight, he gained a little strength. However, he is quite weak and ill now, and breathing raggedly. I don’t know how much longer he can survive."),
