          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Crelanu",
            text: _("There <i>is no secret</i>, you fools! Magic cannot stop aging. You cannot live forever. It is the way of nature, and the greatest thing we have in common with all of creation. You <i>must</i> die, and your soul depart. I would not try this thing for any reason."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
